{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15883","headline":"寄中书李舍人 · 张南史","name":"寄中书李舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨宵凄断处，对月与临风。\n鹤病三江上，兰衰百草中。\n题诗随谢客，饮酒寄黄翁。\n早岁心相待，还因贵贱同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张南史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}